gn: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">作品名稱</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">〈Khiàng姆--à beh起行〉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">舞台劇海報</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>演出資訊</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">時間</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">2022/4/9 (六)&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">14:30</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">19:30&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">主辦</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">夾腳拖劇團&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">02-2322-5638&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">訂票</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a href=\"https://reurl.cc/vegGVl\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/vegGVl</a></span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>簡介</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">改編自清文ê小說《虱目仔 ê 滋味》篇章〈Khiàng姆--à beh起行〉。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">編導：吳易蓁&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">原著：清文</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">製作人：陳怡廷</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">行政：林怡辰</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">演員：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">李玉嵐、何安妘、周羿</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">陳佳豪、鄭鈺儒、錢君銜</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">語言指導：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">李江却台語文教基金會</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">執行長 陳豐惠</span></p><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"background-color: white; font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;_